{"type":"npc","name":"Dimension Ooze","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":250,"temp":0,"max":250,"details":""},"ac":{"value":17,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":5,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":"dimensional squeeze"},"immunities":[{"type":"critical-hits","exceptions":[]},{"type":"precision","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]},{"type":"visual","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"force","value":10,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":9},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Dimension oozes spontaneously take form around significant releases of space-bending magic. They are then drawn to feed on any sources of such magic, from specimens as small as a spacious pouch to ones as impressive as permanent interdimensional portals. Indeed, as they make no distinction between themselves and their food sources, a meeting of dimension oozes generally results in a cannibalistic feeding frenzy. While those who fear the ooze's appetites might initially believe such meetings would reduce the threat, the oozy spectacle invariably ends with a single, far larger, and more powerful dimension ooze emerging to continue its hungry rampage.</p><p>Dimension oozes have been known to \"leak\" from plane to plane, drawn by the scent of teleportation magic, to suddenly spring upon a careless caster or unattended magical item. They are a particular danger during the creation of teleportation circles, as their unexpected emergence at the culmination of the ritual can turn a celebration of magical accomplishment into a scene of terror. High-end shops that sell magic items must also take precautions to prevent the oozes from eating their merchandise.</p><h2>Living Portals</h2><p>Images of distant worlds, alien planets, and perhaps even alternate realities are often seen winking in and out across a dimension ooze's iridescent surface. Though this might suggest that the ooze also exists in those places—effectively inhabiting multiple locations at once—to date, all attempts to use dimension oozes for instantaneous travel have ended in failure. Furthermore, the discovery of acid-scarred bones from creatures engulfed by a dimension ooze serves as further evidence that exploring this endeavor further is likely to be futile.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 90/200/360 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), perception item, skill items (Athletics)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, constitution, energy resistant (vitality), force, fortification, space, space shield, spells (Occult: @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.VlNcjmYyu95vOUe8]{Translocate}), strength, throwing, time, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Arun Varma","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":6},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":-5},"wis":{"mod":0},"cha":{"mod":-5}},"perception":{"details":"spacewarp sense (precise) 120 feet","mod":12,"senses":[{"type":"motion-sense","acuity":"imprecise","range":60}],"vision":false},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":21,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":18,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":13,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":20}},"traits":{"value":["mindless","ooze"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"lg"}}},"_id":"REGya8TV5IQPPkrp","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/dimension-ooze.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Dimension Ooze","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":2,"height":2,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/dimension-ooze.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2