sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"8e5QJfIXcMW6fFhz"},{"folder":"7cyoYPoPYA01mErU","img":"icons/magic/symbols/ring-circle-smoke-blue.webp","name":"Translocate (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"translocate","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","teleportation"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"D34mZGkwHfrw6o1Z","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"5":{"range":{"value":"1 mile"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.VlNcjmYyu95vOUe8","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"f30ru06aaOBbsc8C"},{"type":"action","name":"Motion Sense","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A dimension ooze can sense nearby motion through vibration and air movement.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"9XzzABTry3crepnZ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Spacewarp Sense","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The dimension ooze immediately knows the precise origin point and destination of any creatures affected by a teleportation effect within the listed range. It can also pinpoint the location of any extraplanar spaces, even those within objects such as a <em>spacious pouch</em>.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"cmISYme8h3B0Il8d","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Devour Magic","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within the dimension ooze's reach uses an effect with the teleportation or extradimensional traits</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The dimension ooze makes a pseudopod Strike against the creature. This Strike neither applies nor counts toward the dimension ooze's multiple attack penalty. On a hit, the ooze attempts to counteract the effect (counteract modifier [[/r 1d20+20 #Counteract]]{+20}). If the counteract check succeeds, the ooze becomes @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened} until the end of its next turn. It can use the quickened action to Stride or Strike.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"NiOyJZStpEX4zU8h","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Withdraw","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p><p><strong>Trigger</strong> The dimension ooze takes damage</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The ooze retreats into a temporary extraplanar space until the start of its next turn. At the beginning of its next turn, it reappears in a random unoccupied space within 10 feet of its original location.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["extradimensional","occult","teleportation"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"k9RESYE4kueNq3ti","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Pseudopod","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["magical","unarmed"]},"damageRolls":{"NPDK4IpN1c6Mzikj":{"damage":"2d8+10","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null},"GQ37qkwmKvHcxlYT":{"damage":"2d6","damageType":"force","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":19},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"GLSmOz5wY4Ur7fNB","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Spatial Distortion","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["force","magical","range-increment-30"]},"damageRolls":{"rR0h16hHcQajs1FH":{"damage":"6d6","damageType":"force","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":19},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"YltFLqTQ4KobdPU2","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Dimensional Squeeze","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The dimension ooze can slip between the cracks of the physical world. When it moves or makes a pseudopod Strike, it treats any square within 30 feet as adjacent to it. This effectively grants its pseudopod Strikes 30 feet of reach and allows it to Step or Stride up to 30 feet despite its Speed unless this special ability is prevented from functioning.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["occult","teleportation"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"tBkJeWWZ1gV7ooIA","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Engulf","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Check[reflex|dc:28], @Damage[(3d10)[force]] damage, [[/act escape dc=28]], Rupture 15</p><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Engulf]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"engulf","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"deathNote":false},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.zU3Ovaet4xQ5Gmvy","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"xN5BBOy3PGtxJ3UA"}],"effects":[],"sort":9400000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}